/* FAQ */
const FAQ=[['What is CREED Neurovascular Framework?','A learning platform that joins neuroscience, exam preparation (WAEC, JAMB, NECO, GCE, IELTS) and study tools. Its idea is that focus, rest and good study habits support how the brain learns.'],['Is it free?','Yes. Signing up is free. A free student can connect with up to 2 tutors; the paid monthly and lifetime plans remove that limit.'],['How do I sign up as a tutor?','Choose "I am a Tutor" on the sign-up form and add your subjects and a WhatsApp number or meeting link. Students can then find you on the Tutors page.'],['Why are the calculator and Pomodoro timer locked?','They are for registered users. Sign up free to unlock both.'],['How do assignments work?','Tutors publish assignments. Connected students submit a written answer or a small file (under 400 KB), and tutors give a score and feedback.'],['Why can\'t I like or follow reels?','Anyone can watch reels. Liking, following, saving and sharing need an account.'],['Which exams are covered?','WAEC, JAMB, NECO, GCE, IELTS, Post-UTME and SAT/TOEFL.'],['How do I earn a certificate?','Score 70% or more in a quiz, then download your certificate from the dashboard.'],['Where is my data stored?','In your own browser on this device. Do not reuse an important password here.']];
